{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "45e79da8c2c2442a997c1ad9744ca7f6120aadf17044a7e0b8f3a4bcf1ac9920", "ja": "961プロの控室にて。デュオとしてレッス\nンを終え、玲音と詩花が会話しているところ\nに黒井社長が。765プロが提出してきた曲\nを持ってきたと言う。曲を聴いた3人は、三\n者三様に燃え上がるのだった。", "zh": "在961事务所的休息室里。玲音和诗花作为双人组合刚结束课程，正在交谈时黑井社长出现了。他说自己带来了765事务所提交过来的曲子。听过这首曲子的3人，各自燃起了斗志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1001_201xxx", "source_sha256": "b338a7fbb744a17f308753302c1079dfe52a19ec8266d5daf87583ddb510d174", "ja": "ふぅ。レッスン、お疲れさまでした。やっぱり、\nさすがですね！　私、ついていくのがやっとで……。", "zh": "呼……辛苦了，练习结束了。果然不愧是你！我都快跟不上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1002_202xxx", "source_sha256": "d5f0b872fd85d046688004f8712af13cd769ce7c47289e1722f67eacab945be3", "ja": "ゴメンゴメン、無理させちゃったかな？\n詩花の笑顔に乗せられて、つい飛ばしちゃって。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，是不是让你太勉强了？\n被诗花的笑容带动得一兴奋，就不小心加快了速度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1003_201xxx", "source_sha256": "0ed29da8566a571ad628c64cb2b0f9102c4e9d40520787126be8732037349848", "ja": "そ、それは……私、うれしかったんです。\nお姉さまと並んで踊れることが、とっても。", "zh": "那、那个……我其实很开心。\n能和姐姐并肩起舞，我真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1004_202xxx", "source_sha256": "f0d5c5e62113ca71a999862518df1dbd72f5ea022cd9e737589194f108635f39", "ja": "アタシも、詩花と踊るのは楽しいよ！\nというか、詩花じゃなければ、デュオは組まなかった。", "zh": "我和诗花一起跳舞也很开心哦！\n或者说，如果不是诗花，我根本不会组双人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1005_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ad04d59223f2e6ec096fba772cbb9c8b4fce749ff65a7a83ea5b32306c1ccc1c", "ja": "お姉さま……。\nあの、私、まだ足手まといですよね。ごめんなさい。", "zh": "姐姐……  \n那个，我现在还是会拖后腿吧。对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "06494307c843cd3ca64b6afab477949626726f980a6a36c5ab2d70638481bf17", "ja": "でも、絶対についていきます。そうなります！　だから\nお姉さまはふり返らないで、自由に飛ばしてください！", "zh": "不过，我绝对会跟上的。我一定会做到！所以，姐姐不要回头，尽管自由地飞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1007_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c37295e4059a827af39f4b392e8889afa004df469da78a3e41c63acd9f9b0467", "ja": "そう……。フフッ、わかった。\nじゃあ、次は全開で行ってみようか！", "zh": "这样啊……呵呵，我明白了。\n那么，接下来就全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1008_se", "source_sha256": "b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e", "ja": "ガチャッ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1009_kuroi", "source_sha256": "12a4cef32113f8bc1deccf40afdb759de6551335a8edc939d88c0887d7e70bd3", "ja": "フンッ！！", "zh": "哼！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9f0a61f19863fafd0fc7529c18bce13b4b851aee975d2b350e3583912ce8323e", "ja": "あ、社長！　……？　どうかしたんですか？\n顔色が、ほんのり赤黒いですけど……。", "zh": "啊，社长！……？您这是怎么了？\n脸色好像有点发红发黑的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1011_kuroi", "source_sha256": "5fd5899248fed94e6d43d1560a6409e287310bc2d16bcd365d52ac9cd311ff73", "ja": "765プロが『アイメガ』用の曲を提出してきたのだ。\n一応、持ってきてやったぞ。", "zh": "765事务所提交了用于“爱偶像”的歌曲。\n我顺便给你带过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1012_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c88afa587d00751a3f3e761eb569e0c161cb6e06a975e5a4bb743b2800c0ea3b", "ja": "我那覇と伊吹の曲？　やった、ついに来たんだね！\n早く聞かせてよ、社長！", "zh": "我那霸和伊吹的歌？太好了，终于送来了！  \n社长，快点放给我们听嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "10155dad234a9afe03d8c57c81708be4caad12303495df81bb95071b5da18fe7", "ja": "私も、すぐに聞きたいです！\n早く早くっ、お願いパ……お願いします、社長！", "zh": "我也想马上听！快点快点，拜托……拜托了，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1014_kuroi", "source_sha256": "f96ecf13a84f4b297d61105773bc1930b66e54475f980dbe3542bf64f9f9a89f", "ja": "私はこれっぽっちも聞きたくもないがな。\nそうだ、耳がくさらないよう耳栓をしておこう。", "zh": "我可是一点都不想听。对了，先戴上耳塞，免得耳朵烂掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1015_kuroi", "source_sha256": "08a0d11e140f0e09795a70961eab23f2b63ae277fd70e571cc6e241685023993", "ja": "では、二人で勝手に聞くがいい。\nスイッチ、フンッ！", "zh": "那你们两个想怎么听就怎么听吧。\n开关，哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1018_202xxx", "source_sha256": "8966be111fbadd34c96dd6b9161bc7d7540d94711cc791d4f7e0096c6df436b2", "ja": "うん……いいね。みなぎるような情熱が伝わってくる。\nフフッ、アツいナンバーじゃないか♪", "zh": "嗯……不错呢。能感受到满溢而出的热情。\n呵呵，是一首劲爆的曲子嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "aae1356161598a3177cc80f98dde6edc31d7bcfef6c58072785b94510beaafbc", "ja": "本当にステキな曲！　響ちゃんと翼ちゃんが\nこれを歌うんですね……早く聞いてみたいなぁ♪", "zh": "真是首棒极了的歌！原来是响和翼来唱啊……真想早点听到呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1020_kuroi", "source_sha256": "23c3262dbad3f52c628aa56f661f3b96706b954a5e007c0e9905b48fa6a8d86d", "ja": "ハッ、この程度か。こんな曲を聞くくらいなら、\n歯医者さんの音でも聞いていた方がマシだ！", "zh": "哈，这点程度吗？与其听这种歌，倒不如去听牙医的声音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1021_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6bf5f60ca8197982e7f7cb1ba565d5df5682372ed3fc6a9b2762ce2f0e9dcd49", "ja": "……社長、耳栓してたんじゃないんですか？", "zh": "……社长，您不是戴着耳塞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1022_kuroi", "source_sha256": "41fc13945cbd22d421d93274e48df009db05021727a8f28b62b18d6ab85683b3", "ja": "雑音ほど、よく響くのだよ。しかも私の耳は\nとびきり繊細なのだ。ええい、忌々しい。", "zh": "越是噪音，越是响亮。况且我的耳朵格外敏感。真是恼人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1023_kuroi", "source_sha256": "f9f5570523a34427ecdae149233e3e358ab8a685c2bbb9349516ab6460bd7f1d", "ja": "とにかくッ！　玲音、君の望み通り、舞台は整えた。\n甘ったれの765プロの反応も、私の予想どおりだ。", "zh": "总之！玲音，舞台已经如你所愿准备好了。  \n那个娇生惯养的765制作人的反应，也和我预料的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1024_kuroi", "source_sha256": "f342c2c0dfd956b69e4610bc1090900888266978df9bebf80867fbd5d900fbb9", "ja": "次は君の番だ。私に……いや、私と詩花に、\n見せてくれるんだろうな。", "zh": "接下来轮到你了。你会展示给我……不，是给我和诗花看的，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1025_kuroi", "source_sha256": "ac9ac015a1cadd83e87922473f32f74355c45dbba160ca2030ecc0701532cd9e", "ja": "世界を震撼させた、君の本気を。本物の『玲音』を！\nこの私が用意した、最高の舞台装置……", "zh": "让世界为之震撼的，你的全力。真正的『玲音』！\n这可是我准备的，最棒的舞台装置……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1026_kuroi", "source_sha256": "63167135c1b0e0e7348803259ade64c3aea7d85e65d76906a64b6560fc753aa7", "ja": "至高のデュオユニット、\n『ZWEIGLANZ』として！！！", "zh": "作为至高的双人组合，\n『ZWEIGLANZ』！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1028_202xxx", "source_sha256": "09ef5b7ce7e0169ecd308ce5249ad37228dbe94ebf63c62f73dc1b1354a2f82e", "ja": "……キミらしくもないね、黒井。\nいや、むしろキミらしいのかな？", "zh": "……真不像你的作风啊，黑井。\n不，或者说这反而挺像你的作风？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1029_202xxx", "source_sha256": "9dffe83cd63740f04163cf848765e049702e8f01f1f6848fef31b16da5c1f3cb", "ja": "だけど、敢えて言わせてもらうよ。\n……そんなことは、当たり前だ。", "zh": "不过，我还是要特意说一句。\n……那是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1030_kuroi", "source_sha256": "2e7a8c307f429485f0e12cf6bcd4bb206f939e3f803b5a3d49b33721624b0645", "ja": "……ほほう？", "zh": "……哦吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1031_202xxx", "source_sha256": "35c81c676f7beafb2aae58615ef340375b4cec497e49a681df638e637a994ae4", "ja": "アタシは玲音。限界なんてモノはない。\n目指してるのは、すべてを越えることだけだ。", "zh": "我是玲音。所谓极限根本不存在。\n我所追求的，只有超越一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1032_202xxx", "source_sha256": "f0df192c3435289cc1ac19c70adae0e40eec0b59d74266ceb5c6266e832e5a72", "ja": "見せてあげるよ。キミに、この国に、世界に！\nトップギアで極限を突き破る輝きをね。", "zh": "让你见识一下吧。让你、让这个国家、让全世界都见识一下！见识那用最高档位冲破极限的耀眼光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1033_202xxx", "source_sha256": "a53ea9e4f0f4bfa2a6a1f4c29f94a5d38a1b3797693b25dedccf3a1583832d29", "ja": "ただし、詩花。その輝きは、キミも作り出せ！\n『ZWEIGLANZ』の名の通り輝きは二つ！　いいね！", "zh": "不过，诗花。那份光辉，也由你亲手创造出来！正如『ZWEIGLANZ』之名，光辉可是有两道！很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1034_201xxx", "source_sha256": "02e5aeba4c19a79d86265afa7c39926365da1a2b3013111972d8a7efaa4d7b0e", "ja": "……っ！　はいっ、お姉さま！", "zh": "……！好的，姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_02_1035_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c93bf2dcd6658d83b83b0cd85d7223931e25149169051ffb6b8996e166aa6bc8", "ja": "私も必ず、応えてみせます。お姉さまと……社長と。\nそれから、私自身の気持ちに！", "zh": "我也一定会回应的。回应姐姐……社长，还有我自己的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
